{"about_the_game":"A place to <strong>unwind, mix drinks, and serve warm meals</strong> to charming guests\u2014whether in f<strong>ullscreen or tucked neatly at the bottom of your screen</strong> as you go about your day.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/35eabf4b3dc1567411f4bd3e0a87fd90.poster.avif?t=1759818579\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/35eabf4b3dc1567411f4bd3e0a87fd90.webm?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/35eabf4b3dc1567411f4bd3e0a87fd90.mp4?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a16b036f350b234be12a12d598f31e21.webp?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=59 /></span><br><br>Keep your bar stocked, set the perfect table, and welcome your guests with care. After all, the heart of a great bar is the people inside it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.poster.avif?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.webm?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.mp4?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/9158f69580d49e3528e70d7520b6a82f.webp?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=59 /></span><br><br>Hire staff to keep things running while you sit back and relax. No rush, no pressure\u2014just the soothing hum of a bar that flows on its own.<br>And... of course, if the mood strikes, you can always jump in.               <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.poster.avif?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.webm?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.mp4?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/37b19703bb1630191281a58163377dda.webp?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=59 /></span><br><br>Style your bar, set the mood, and make it the coziest spot by the lake. And don\u2019t forget the little yard above\u2014it\u2019s yours to decorate and shape however you like.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.poster.avif?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.webm?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.mp4?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/3c70c82ac29f273be85f09b16ba60e67.webp?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=59 /></span><br><br>Lakeside Bar isn\u2019t just about simple routines\u2014there\u2019s always something fun to do. Try your hand at fishing, test your aim at darts, and stay tuned for more surprises!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/eb20fe16e8fb3657bdaf4e6053405ff0.poster.avif?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/eb20fe16e8fb3657bdaf4e6053405ff0.webm?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/eb20fe16e8fb3657bdaf4e6053405ff0.mp4?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/eeeecb6df5194cb6bcee2edc4d91171a.webp?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=59 /></span><br><br>Just enter your Twitch channel name, and Lakeside Bar will link your chatters' names to customers in the game, turning them into guests at your bar.<br>A little touch of magic to bring you and your community closer together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/ddc353d7e12d655bb142ab508da54fe2.avif?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=100 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/e2f755d0ea9cc90259a0f04c834e0cf0.webp?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=59 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock new drinks, snacks, and music.<br></li><li>Try out fresh recipes to impress your guests.<br></li><li>Expand your resources for a smoother flow.<br></li><li>And much more, all at your pace!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"In the beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/f6e1c334f7180c193bba1b79dc373fdc2f0c74b2.jpg"},{"name":"Word of mouth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/840091f3a2fdbfcc1b28af49dcfa888d1d83bb34.jpg"},{"name":"Booming business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/b621af677f340bc377e0e4183b3d868adb2f442d.jpg"},{"name":"Bar of the People","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/54ef883f823a233654422b53803d555e57b4cd40.jpg"},{"name":"Now Hiring!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/95324f1a6ee7c2843a531785faff3e1bfd5d4f9a.jpg"},{"name":"Get Out!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/b75e142d0303f7078c8f9191a60a3a48ed0385c4.jpg"},{"name":"Expanding business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/13b061966686bad7f499add12b3ae4f2a78d493c.jpg"},{"name":"Flows in like water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/62f75512459c9df50fe83f900a78616ff56a0ec8.jpg"},{"name":"Cozy bonfire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/c7c17728332676eee1f716accac05349958de9de.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Angler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417120/be4dceb7e2b34ff3d26eac9b41808d32e84a358f.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417120?t=1759818579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/63a2cc62