 yours to decorate and shape however you like.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.poster.avif?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.webm?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.mp4?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/3c70c82ac29f273be85f09b16ba60e67.webp?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=59 /></span><br><br>Lakeside Bar isn\u2019t just about simple routines\u2014there\u2019s always something fun to do. Try your hand at fishing, test your aim at darts, and stay tuned for more surprises!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/eb20fe16e8fb3657bdaf4e6053405ff0.poster.avif?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/eb20fe16e8fb3657bdaf4e6053405ff0.webm?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/eb20fe16e8fb3657bdaf4e6053405ff0.mp4?t=1759818579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/eeeecb6df5194cb6bcee2edc4d91171a.webp?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=59 /></span><br><br>Just enter your Twitch channel name, and Lakeside Bar will link your chatters' names to customers in the game, turning them into guests at your bar.<br>A little touch of magic to bring you and your community closer together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/ddc353d7e12d655bb142ab508da54fe2.avif?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=100 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/e2f755d0ea9cc90259a0f04c834e0cf0.webp?t=1759818579\" width=608 height=59 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock new drinks, snacks, and music.<br></li><li>Try out fresh recipes to impress your guests.<br></li><li>Expand your resources for a smoother flow.<br></li><li>And much more, all at your pace!</li></ul>","developers":["BITCOVER"],"dlc":[4056310,3875140],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/18a1349a5a53c64cca60498d1d4597976a0c4880/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1759818579","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3417120/2091695883/3e8808248f36a7a29af7ae2780cefbea10d7e531/1753343051/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753345317","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3417120/2091695883/3e8808248f36a7a29af7ae2780cefbea10d7e531/1753343051/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753345317","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3417120/2091695883/3e8808248f36a7a29af7ae2780cefbea10d7e531/1753343051/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753345317","id":257173271,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173271/movie480.mp4?t=1753345317","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173271/movie_max.mp4?t=17533